Description: Fit the Bayesian version of the LPE (logistic positive exponential), RLPE
    (reversal logistic positive exponential), 1PLPE, 1PRLPE, 2PL and 1PL models using CmdStanR. 
    Furthermore,the package allows computing predictive metrics (e.g., WAIC, LOO, and DIC),
    simulating data from some models (1PRLPE, 1PLPE, LPE, RLPE) and also allows the user to 
    obtain the Item Characteristic Curve and Item Information function according to each model.
    References: Bazán et al. (2010) <doi:10.3102/1076998610375834>; 
    Bazán et al. (2023) <doi:10.1214/22-BJPS558>
    Samejima (1999).
